:"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122851.patch","merged_at":"2026-08-28T17:02:17Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Follow-up of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122596\r\n- Follow-up of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122751\r\n\r\n`GDType` so far has been adopting the name \"property\" for all its members. This is terminologically incorrect: \"property\" is what we call a stored field, and \"member\" is anything that can be accessed with dot notation.\r\n\r\nTo remedy this, this PR renames `GDType::Property` to `GDType::Member`, and `GDType::Property::SetGet` to `GDType::Member::Property`, which matches the expected terminology better.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nNo behavior change expected.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122851/reactions","t